Z||000003||stimpy||03-05-2001||10:24 PM||||I've been kicking aroundan idea for smoked plexi lens covers for the turn signals. If you used a small "L" bracket on each side of the opening, you could rivet the covers flush to the bumper. I thnk that would look exceptionally good on a black car, say an 86 SE.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
