Z||000005||rodmcneill||03-05-2001||11:59 PM||||Stimpy, I have thinking about the same mod. I was thinking about using extra long bolts that would screw into the turn signal light where the original screws went. Some small dia. plastic tubing on the bolts would act as a spacer between the plexi. and the lens. Some soft plastic tubing could possibly be used around the perimeter of the plexi. to finish it off-prevent scuffs. I think this mod. would make the front end more aerodynamic, right now you have a couple of big "holes" that probably creates a lot of turbulence.||||reg||1
